notes:
WEA message: Evacuation for {location}

Evacuation order on Maui for Wahikuli Subdivision in Lahaina due to the Brushfire. Repeat, Evacuation order on Maui for Wahikuli Subdivision in Lahaina due to the Brushfire.

Evacuate your family and pets now, do not delay. Evacuate North out of town toward Kapalua. Expect conditions that may make driving difficult and watch for public safety personnel operating in the area. Sent by the Maui Emergency Management Agency.
